prompts.tool.preview_start.description:
By name from .mewrk/launch.json; create it if missing:
{
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "name": "<unique-name>",
      "runtimeExecutable": "<command>",
      "runtimeArgs": ["<args>"],
      "port": <port>
    }
  ]
}
Optional "url" opens the preview there; a localhost url is the bare origin matching port. An entry with "url" and no command attaches to a running server.
